<title>CHILE: RESEARCH ALERT-Santa Isabel upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Santa Isabel upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flemings Research upgraded Chilean supermarket chain Santa Isabel SA to buy from hold.</p>
<p>A report by analyst by Marc de Speville cited plans by Argentina's Velox group to acquire 36 percent of Santa Isabel. Velox holds a controlling stake in the Disco chain.</p>
<p>The report said Santa Isabel was the most &quot;inefficient publicly traded food retailer of its size in South America&quot; and that the market did not realize how inefficient it is, but that the Velox purchase will bring expertise.</p>
<p>An improving trend in near-term results should be visible soon, and the company's upside outweighs the downside, the report said.</p>
<p>((--Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-699-5595 x211))</p>
</text>
